{"availability":"available","full":"DogInfantry/Signals-Before-Storms","name":"Signals-Before-Storms","description":"I built a Hidden Markov Model to find market regimes and allocate on them. It does not beat a 60/40, so I published the diagnosis instead of a win, retraction included. Python, leak-proof walk-forward on NIFTY and S&P. The states encode volatility, not direction, and a daily job now checks that on eleven live markets.","category":"Design","language":"Jupyter Notebook","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-07-23T23:13:44Z","updated":"2026-10-10T11:48:23Z","license":"Apache-2.0","branch":"main","homepage":"https://signals-before-storms.vercel.app","topics":["asset-allocation","backtesting","cvxpy","data-visualization","finance","github-actions","hidden-markov-model","hmmlearn","nextjs","portfolio-optimization","python","quantitative-finance","regime-detection","time-series","vercel","walk-forward-validation"],"demo":"https://signals-before-storms.vercel.app/","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-12T07:59:54.545Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-12T07:59:54.545Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-12T07:59:54.545Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-06T15:45:52.594Z","stars":0,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-08T18:19:51.796Z","stars":0,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-11T04:26:30.680Z","stars":0,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-12T07:59:54.545Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Next.js","Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["[](LICENSE) []( [](tests/) []( [](#the-finding) [](#three-live-deployments)","Signals-Before-Storms is an open-source quantitative finance research engine that detects hidden market regimes (Bull, Bear, Crisis) with a Hidden Markov Model, then reallocates a portfolio across equity, cash and gold using per-regime convex optimization, validated with a leak-proof expanding walk-forward backtest. It runs on Indian markets (NIFTY 50, GOLDBEES, LIQUIDBEES, India VIX) as the primary universe and US markets (SPY, TLT, GLD, VIX) as an out-of-sample robustness check.","In plain English. Markets go through calm stretches and violent ones. I built a model that works out which one you are in, without ever letting it see the future. It gets that right, on every market I have tried it on. Then I bet on it in a simulation, and the bet did not pay. Working out why is what this repository is. The states tell you how violent the market is about to be, not which way it is going, and those two things are not the same. Never read a backtest before? Start with EXPLAINER.md, which defines every term used here, in plain English, in the order the pipeline uses them."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/DogInfantry/Signals-Before-Storms/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"81bda1aac56de5277e8272ff2bf735dad263c187c26d63134f1b7e19d56c42c6","extractedAt":"2026-10-06T15:45:52.729Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-12T07:59:54.677Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"[](LICENSE) []( [](tests/) []( [](#the-finding) [](#three-live-deployments)","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/DogInfantry/Signals-Before-Storms/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"81bda1aac56de5277e8272ff2bf735dad263c187c26d63134f1b7e19d56c42c6","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/DogInfantry/Signals-Before-Storms/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-12T07:59:54.678Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-10T11:48:23Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/DogInfantry/Signals-Before-Storms/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-12T07:59:54.679Z","hash":"81bda1aac56de5277e8272ff2bf735dad263c187c26d63134f1b7e19d56c42c6","originalBytes":41951,"storedBytes":41951,"truncated":false},"lastDemoCheckedAt":"2026-10-12T07:59:54.545Z","subjects":["Data & dashboards"],"platforms":[],"classification":{"version":4,"method":"local_rules","category":"Design","subjects":["Data & dashboards"],"evidence":[{"subject":"Data & dashboards","source":"metadata","match":"data visualization"}],"platformEvidence":[],"platformSupport":"author_metadata_not_runtime_tested","suggestedSubjects":["Simulation & physics","Portfolios & personal sites","Maths & algorithms"],"reviewRequired":true},"demoHealth":{"url":"https://signals-before-storms.vercel.app/","attemptedAt":"2026-10-11T04:42:08.998Z","probeVersion":3,"status":"working","checkedAt":"2026-10-11T04:42:08.998Z","lastWorkingAt":"2026-10-11T04:42:08.998Z","target":"https://signals-before-storms.vercel.app/","failureCount":0,"consecutiveTemporaryFailures":0,"nextCheckAt":"2026-10-18T04:42:08.998Z"},"previewAttemptAt":"2026-10-11T04:42:08.998Z","previewCheck":{"url":"https://signals-before-storms.vercel.app/","attemptedAt":"2026-10-11T04:42:08.998Z","consecutiveFailures":0,"status":"captured","reason":null,"nextCheckAt":"2026-10-18T04:42:08.998Z"},"screenshots":[{"src":"previews/6795f927fa895d4408267174.jpg","kind":"demo","capturedAt":"2026-10-11T04:42:08.998Z","url":"https://signals-before-storms.vercel.app/"}],"qualityPriority":false,"repositoryEtag":"W/\"d03666191f8fc9bf6e1034c8a69fcb972d1f38601e1754d7f9f742d48d9fe83a\"","repositoryEtagFor":"DogInfantry/Signals-Before-Storms","overviewAttemptAt":"2026-10-08T18:26:54.508Z","spaces":[]}